{"3963620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "妹居物语", "steam_appid": 3963620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>《妹居物语》是一款深度融合 AI 的生活、恋爱模拟游戏。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你将与妹妹Yuki一同生活，她会与你聊天、外出、玩游戏，并随着时间逐渐成长为独一无二的存在。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuki 不是固定的剧本角色，而是真正会记住你的对话、喜好、习惯的家人。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>核心特色</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI 互动</strong>：实时对话 + Live2D动画 + 实时配音</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>多性格路线</strong>：Yuki会根据玩家行为发展为可爱、傲娇或病娇等不同性格。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>长期记忆</strong>：自动从对话中抽取关键信息并永久记忆。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>现实同步</strong>：与真实时间挂钩，不同时段、节日对话会有不同反馈。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>沉浸体验</strong>：附带桌面宠物模式，根据电脑正在运行的程序不同有不同问候。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>丰富玩法</strong>：仅demo即有旅游、约会、换装、小游戏、战斗、挂机、送礼等玩法。</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>未来更新</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>1、移动端支持</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2、完整的剧情和演出</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3、更多立绘、live2d等美术资源</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4、更丰富的可玩内容</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>《妹居物语》是一款深度融合 AI 的生活、恋爱模拟游戏。</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >你将与妹妹Yuki一同生活，她会与你聊天、外出、玩游戏，并随着时间逐渐成长为独一无二的存在。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuki 不是固定的剧本角色，而是真正会记住你的对话、喜好、习惯的家人。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>核心特色</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI 互动</strong>：实时对话 + Live2D动画 + 实时配音</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>多性格路线</strong>：Yuki会根据玩家行为发展为可爱、傲娇或病娇等不同性格。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>长期记忆</strong>：自动从对话中抽取关键信息并永久记忆。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>现实同步</strong>：与真实时间挂钩，不同时段、节日对话会有不同反馈。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>沉浸体验</strong>：附带桌面宠物模式，根据电脑正在运行的程序不同有不同问候。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>丰富玩法</strong>：仅demo即有旅游、约会、换装、小游戏、战斗、挂机、送礼等玩法。</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>未来更新</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>1、移动端支持</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2、完整的剧情和演出</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3、更多立绘、live2d等美术资源</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4、更丰富的可玩内容</p>", "short_description": "妹居物语是一款与现实时间同步、深度融合AI的文字生活模拟游戏。 Yuki 不是固定的剧本角色，而是真正会记住你的对话、喜好、习惯的家人。", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963620/7962063a0af1b55409cf2bd45c30585ed007fe0d/header.jpg?t=1779098363", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963620/0c41bb6e627bcbd7f0a05d69b319e313e8c679f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779098363", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963620/0c41bb6e627bcbd7f0a05d69b319e313e8c679f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779098363", "website": "https://www.taptap.cn/app/782330", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> <br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["彩奈"], "publishers": ["彩奈"], "demos": [{"appid": 4027870, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "ma